    "title": "Sliding Window Median",
    "category": "Sliding Window",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "Given an array of integers and a window size K, compute the median of every contiguous subarray of size K. For an even-sized window, the median is defined as the average of the two middle values after sorting.",
