    "output": "\u2022 Print the median of every window in order.",
    "constraints": "\u2022 1 \u2264 N \u2264 2 \u00d7 10^5 \u2022 1 \u2264 K \u2264 N \u2022 -10^9 \u2264 Ai \u2264 10^9"
